class Solution {
    public boolean rotateString(String s, String goal) {
        if (s.length() != goal.length()) {
            return false;
        }

        return (s + s).contains(goal);
    }
}

output:
s = "abcde"
goal = "cdeab"

"abcde" + "abcde" becomes:

abcdeabcde

"cdeab" is present, so the answer is:

true
